- src/clawshot/data/world/*.toml, every region file that port.toml names (root.toml, the 22 overworld files from
  kokiri_forest.toml to zoras_fountain.toml, and the 12 dungeon files from deku_tree.toml to ganons_castle.toml):
  regions, events, locations and exits translated from data/World/Overworld.json, data/World/Bosses.json and the
  vanilla dungeon files data/World/{Deku Tree, Dodongos Cavern, Jabu Jabus Belly, Forest Temple, Fire Temple,
  Water Temple, Shadow Temple, Spirit Temple, Bottom of the Well, Ice Cavern, Gerudo Training Ground,
  Ganons Castle}.json, with location types and vanilla items from LocationList.py.
- src/clawshot/data/world/helpers.toml: data/LogicHelpers.json.
- src/clawshot/data/world/items.toml: ItemList.py (item_table).
- src/clawshot/data/world/settings.toml: default values from SettingsList.py, SettingsListTricks.py and World.py.
- src/clawshot/world/rules.py: the rule language and its semantics from RuleParser.py (helper substitution, here()
  and at() as events, constant folding of settings, table settings) and State.py (has_bottle, has_hearts,
  can_live_dmg, has_all_notes_for_song, region_has_shortcuts, ...).
- src/clawshot/world/load.py: the items held from the start, from ItemPool.py (get_pool_core: ocarina buttons, the
  Fire Temple key).
- src/clawshot/world/search.py: the reachability search from Search.py.
- src/clawshot/generate/fill.py: the assumed fill from Fill.py (distribute_items_restrictive, fill_restrictive,
  fill_restrictive_fast, fast_fill).

